§ `Annex VI: the conformity assessment procedure based on internal control`

-- Annex VI is the procedure Article 43(1) and (2) refer to; it is given effect with Article 43 (group General, assumed). Points 2 to 4 state what "the provider verifies" or
-- "examines": a plain statement of the steps of the procedure, read as the provider's duty (no time limit, no consequence: no breach path). Point 1 says what the
-- procedure is ("is ... based on points 2, 3 and 4"): a definition, so a step missing is the text's own no (FALSE).
