        `the provider has carried out point 2 of Annex VI`
    AND `the provider has carried out point 3 of Annex VI`
    AND `the provider has carried out point 4 of Annex VI`
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "is the conformity assessment procedure based on points 2, 3 and 4"

