-- The three steps as three provider rules: nothing owed where the group does not apply; otherwise the provider must take the step.
@ref Annex VI point 2
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the route to high-risk` IS A `Route to high-risk`
      `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` IS A DATE
      `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Role `Annex VI act`
`Annex VI point 2 the provider's duty to verify the quality management system` MEANS
    IF (`Art 40 to 49 Art 2(2) cuts the provision off from the high-risk AI system` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the products are covered by Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section B of Annex I` `the requirements for high-risk AI systems under this Regulation have been integrated in that Union harmonisation legislation` 43 0)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- S14-kind (a list closed by "only"): nothing is owed, because Article 2(2), "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply" to a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (fork F-S14-reach)
    ELSE IF NOT (`Art 40 to 49 the provisions apply to the high-risk AI system on the date asked` `the date asked` `the route to high-risk` `the date the AI system was placed on the market or put into service` `the AI system has been significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III`)
         THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the provisions do not apply on the date asked, or Art 111(2) saves the system
         ELSE PARTY Provider MUST `Annex VI point 2 verify the quality management system`

